    <statement><p>Evaluate <m>\frac{\,d}{\,dt}{\bf r}(g(t))</m> using the Chain Rule:</p>
<p><m>{\bf r}(t)=\left\lt e^t,e^{7 t},-8\right&gt;, \ \ g(t)=7 t - 2</m></p>
<p><m>\frac{\,d}{\,dt}{\bf r}(g(t))=\langle</m><fillin characters="20" name="AnSwEr0001"/>,<fillin characters="20" name="AnSwEr0002"/>
,<fillin characters="20" name="AnSwEr0003"/><m>\rangle</m></p>
